    REFACTOR-0003: the cart holds Drinks, not names and add-on strings
    
    CoffeeCart looked up each drink by name and kept its add-ons as
    strings, so it had to know every add-on to price or describe an item.
    It now holds a Drink[] and asks each one for its description and price,
    without knowing whether it's a plain menu drink or one wrapped in add-ons.
    
    main.ts builds each drink by wrapping a MenuDrink in its add-ons, inside
    out: Whip(Large(Cold Brew)) is a large cold brew with whip. It is the one
    place that names the add-ons.
    
    The output is unchanged.

